{"kind":{"type":"paragraph"},"runs":[{"text":"Every remote entry point takes a ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"Cancel","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" and must stay interruptible: no new blocking call without a cancel poll and an idle budget (","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"CANCEL_POLL","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":", ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"IDLE_TIMEOUT","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" in ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"actions/remote.rs","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"). A blocking read with neither is how a sync gets stuck forever. Build a tokio timer inside the ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"async","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" block, never as an argument to ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"block_on","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":": a ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"Sleep","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" needs the runtime context that ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"block_on","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" has not entered yet.","style":[],"link":null,"image":false}],"quoteDepth":0,"listDepth":1,"marker":"bullet"},
{"kind":{"type":"paragraph"},"runs":[{"text":"The policy settles rows ahead of their write paths on purpose (\"settled policy waiting for its feature\", ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"docs/safety.md","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"): force push, remote branch delete, reset --hard, history rewrite and prune each have a ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"docs/roadmap.md","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" Planned entry and are tested only in ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"lib.rs","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"'s tests. Delete such a variant only with its roadmap entry, together with its ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"risk","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" and ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"Policy::evaluate","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" arms, its tests and its ","style":[],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":"docs/safety.md","style":["code"],"link":null,"image":false},{"text":" row.","style":[],"link":null,"image":false}],"quoteDepth":0,"listDepth":1,"marker":"bullet"},
